  --bucket my-company-specs --prefix projects/

# Git repository (future)
spec project create my-app --storage git \
  --repo https://github.com/myorg/specs.git --branch main
```

Each project independently chooses its storage backend at creation time.
Project configuration is saved to `config.ini` in the project directory.

**Configuration Files:**
- `~/.specd/config.ini` - specd global settings (listen address, default storage)
- `~/.spec/config.ini` - spec-cli global settings (server URL, output format, AI provider)
